<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">Yes, Lonavala has several premium villas and homestays that work well for large groups. Retrofusion Boutique Homestay stands out with its two spacious 4 BHK villas, Neo Retro Villa and Retro Villa, both designed for families, corporate teams, and big friend circles. Private pools, terraces, BBQ setups, and entertainment options such as a Bollywood themed treasure hunt turn the villas into self-contained spaces for celebrations. Because such properties are in high demand during peak months, it is wise to book well in advance for long weekends and festival dates.</p>

